      "postDate": "2026-09-29T11:32:01.507Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "I plotted my CV against the public LB.\n\n![](https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F5927283%2Fc28f1df91e7bc0d065076a6698da889b%2Fcv_lb_public.png?generation=1790681365420102&alt=media)\n\n| CV | LB |\n|---|---|\n| 0.18 | 0.05 |\n| 0.19 | 0.06 |\n| 0.23 | 0.12 |\n| 0.24 | 0.10 |\n\nHigher CV does not seem to translate into a higher LB. How well do your CV and LB correlate?",
      "content": "<p>I plotted my CV against the public LB.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F5927283%2Fc28f1df91e7bc0d065076a6698da889b%2Fcv_lb_public.png?generation=1790681365420102&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CV</th>\n<th>LB</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>0.18</td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.19</td>\n<td>0.06</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.23</td>\n<td>0.12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.24</td>\n<td>0.10</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Higher CV does not seem to translate into a higher LB. How well do your CV and LB correlate?</p>",
